WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.438
The handover strip begins with a particular assignment and period. A deputy’s

00:00:04.438 --> 00:00:08.875
job title alone does not show that this work has been accepted.

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:14.592
The incoming owner needs competence, specific authority, individual access and the current

00:00:14.592 --> 00:00:20.117
work record. Show open actions, owners, deadlines and unresolved gaps.

00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:25.883
Administrative cover and control-room monitoring are different lanes. Obtain the relevant acceptance

00:00:25.883 --> 00:00:31.433
in each lane, notify affected people and escalate any unaccepted gap.
